 ],
 "text": "As of 15 November 2026, the nine reserved-seat members comprise six women and three technocrats/professionals; there is no separate minority/non-Muslim reserved category. These members were notified on 19 June 2026 and sworn in on 22 June. The assembly’s online member directory has not been updated for the fourth assembly, so the seat-by-seat identifications rely on contemporary reporting of the election commission’s returned-candidate notification. No reserved-seat by-election or subsequent vacancy was identified."
}